ou're briefly invulnerable and blink red, so a whole crowd can't take you down instantly.Lose all your hearts and it's over — you'll Prestige automatically.Prefer a chill run? Toggle Easy Mode in the main menu to play without health.Down to your last heart? The music turns tense until you heal back up.⚡ New Prestige UpgradesVita","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:07:14Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691573","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:10:35Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5140630-1844751498226098","game_id":"steam-5140630","kind":"announcement","title":"Over The Gnome! 1.3.1","summary":"⚡ Buff FeedbackSpawn — a purple poof pops on every gnome that appears while the spawn power-up is active, so it really feels like the world floods with gnomes.Speed — cartoon speed lines at the screen edges while the speed power-up is active.Gold — a warm golden glow during the gold power-up.Size — the camera pulls back while you're giant.Upgrades — buying an upgrade lands with a punch and a pulse.👤 ShadowsThe gnomes cast soft shadows, adding depth to every scene. (The player stone has no shadow","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-25T22:49:15Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498226098","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:10:35Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5140630-1844751498219734","game_id":"steam-5140630","kind":"announcement","title":"Over The Gnome! 1.3.0","summary":"⚡ Faster ProgressionUpgrades now cost less, so you can grow your build and reach new prestige levels faster.🧱 Fixed CollidersThe map is now fully sealed — you can no longer slip out of the play area.🎓 New Player TutorialNew to the game? A friendly tutorial now walks you through the ropes:Move to crush gnomes!Spend your gold on upgrades once you can afford them.Prestige to earn permanent upgrades — a reminder shows up if you keep playing without doing it.Hunt treasure gnomes for big gold.Learn wh","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-23T22:29:54Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498219734","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:10:35Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5140630-1842212951310461","game_id":"steam-5140630","kind":"announcement","title":"Over The Gnome! Beta 1.1.0","summary":"🌍 New Languages!The game is now available in 9 languages:SpanishEnglishFrenchItalianPortugueseRussianJapaneseKoreanSimplified ChineseYou can switch language from the menu at any time. All texts, menus, and the skill tree are fully translated.🧟 New Gnome: the MUMMY!A very special gnome that never gives up:When you crush it, it stays on the ground... until it revives, getting back up little by little.It gradually recovers its size and returns to normal.It's impossible to eliminate: if you leave it","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-31T14:53:57Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951310461","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:10:35Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5140630-1842212951308385","game_id":"steam-5140630","kind":"announcement","title":"Over The Gnome! Beta 1.0.1","summary":"Animations & FeedbackPrestige button now shows a pulse + shake call-to-action that intensifies with the unclaimed prestige you're carrying (peaks at 10).Gnomes grow from a tiny size to full scale when they spawn.Mushrooms grow in when they appear, pulse while idle, and flatten/squash when you collect them before vanishing.AudioFixed audio mixer routing: the Effects and Voice volume sliders now apply separately and correctly.Bug FixesFixed the scale of player images in the ranking/leaderboard.Var","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-30T19:49:32Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951308385","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:10:35Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5140630":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T08:45:52Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T08:45:52Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-5140630":"2026-10-26T08:45:52Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"5140630":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T08:45:52Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T08:45:52Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T08:45:52Z"},"5147470":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T08:45:52Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T08:45:52Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T08:45:52Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-5140630","app_id":5140630,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:35Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"6d3594d1d062bde4ae531460e3bf252bab66329244d6c48d8deba5f25c1a70d3","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"Become a giant gnome-crushing boulder. Chase the treasure gnomes, shrink the giant yetis with your shrink ray, grow and improve until you crush them all. Travel through 5 unique worlds, prestige, and unlock permanent talents to become unstoppable.","publishers":[{"name":"Cháchara! Games"}],"developers":[{"name":"Cháchara! Games"}]},"release":{"steam_release_date":1798704000,"is_coming_soon":true,"coming_soon_display":"date_quarter"},"trailers":{"highlights"